<title>USA: TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $714,250</p>
<p>Advanta Championships tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>2-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>5-7 6-1</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>5-7 7-5</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark)</p>
<p>7-6 (9-7) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-3 0-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
</text>
